            {
                "entry_id": "46133aa5-de77-3661-9ee2-4820e62c2fb6",
                "word": "teratoid",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "3c8efce7-2589-4699-b85f-b02aa32263ab",
                        "entry_id": "46133aa5-de77-3661-9ee2-4820e62c2fb6",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "teratoids"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "90db570b-9bb9-32fc-acab-4ff837cfd648",
                        "entry_id": "46133aa5-de77-3661-9ee2-4820e62c2fb6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An abnormal tumor similar to a teratoma."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "85b91205-e180-4922-a795-f07a95b4cc54",
                                "sense_id": "90db570b-9bb9-32fc-acab-4ff837cfd648",
                                "text": "In each of these divisions there are subdivisions, according as the parasite consists of a more or less recognisable fœtus, or only of a mass of fœtal tissue (teratomata, teratoids, dermoids)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e3a74ae3-fde5-45e5-b8f7-0c637fc9979e",
                                "sense_id": "90db570b-9bb9-32fc-acab-4ff837cfd648",
                                "text": "They can be divided into dermoids (only an epithelial layer present) and teratoids (all three germ layers present)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "068944a2-0ae3-3723-a59d-a1eb79d0d38b",
                        "entry_id": "46133aa5-de77-3661-9ee2-4820e62c2fb6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A mutant."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7945575b-33e8-4693-b865-df2ab1de010d",
                                "sense_id": "068944a2-0ae3-3723-a59d-a1eb79d0d38b",
                                "text": "I wanted to explore how at the launch of a new millennium many people were beginning to feel like teratoids in the global commodity exchange."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3566de3b-78d2-46e3-b15f-77be03f8e229",
                                "sense_id": "068944a2-0ae3-3723-a59d-a1eb79d0d38b",
                                "text": "The objects floating in the bath and lazing about on the bathroom's floor are all monsters, teratoids dehumanized by the husking of their clothes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3fcf18af-0d34-400a-ab18-98da6e819ac5",
                                "sense_id": "068944a2-0ae3-3723-a59d-a1eb79d0d38b",
                                "text": "He had little time, however, to ponder his lack of reflex, for new incident forced his attention back to the ridge where the four teratoids had first broken from cover."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
